 "caption": "Accuracy against size for dinov2_vitb14_reg: validation k-NN top-1 (all 50,000 images) against the fraction of the original's parameters. SVD-LLM alone (open squares) against Mirror Surgery, extended below its own size by SVD-LLM inside the even and odd blocks (filled circles: exactly mirror-invariant in one forward pass); Mirror Surgery on the first 9 blocks only shows the price of exactness; the original distilled with the same recipe anchors the top. Stars are flip-averaged models (two forward passes), placed at their analytic compute relative to the original's single pass. Error bars: one standard deviation over healing seeds (n = 2, 3)."
